OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Facross much of the region with a
OL,7,Flittle rain possible mainly in the
OL,8,Fsouth. Clearer spells may develop in
OL,9,Fthe north at times, with a touch of
OL,10,Fgrass frost possible in the most
OL,11,Fsheltered rural areas. Mostly light
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FWidely cloudy across the
OL,15,Fregion with the odd spot of rain in
OL,16,Fthe south. Clearer and brighter
OL,17,Fconditions move southwards to allow
OL,18,Fsome sunny spells. Near-normal
OL,19,Ftemperatures, colder overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
