OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBecoming drier and brighter with some
OL,7,Fsunshine later in the week and into
OL,8,Fthe weekend as temperatures fall away,
OL,9,Fwith overnight frosts developing
OL,10,Fwidely.
